{"id":"6a64ba5f871237a2","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-reduct.md","title":"Reduct","display":"df-reduct — Reduct","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-reduct","aliases":["57-df-reduct"],"display":"df-reduct — Reduct","depends_on":["[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-function-restriction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-reduct"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-reduct</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reduct — Reduct"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"691f08ea84f57992\" href=\"?note=691f08ea84f57992\" title=\"57-df-function-restriction\">57-df-function-restriction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0,S\">\\(S_0,S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a> 的同一变量及逻辑字母，且对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}_n(S_0)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Func}_n(S_0)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Func}_n(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S_0)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S_0)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\)</span>；此处 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0\\subseteq S\">\\(S_0\\subseteq S\\)</span> 是元数与类别均相容的子签名。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)\">\\(\\mathfrak A=\\langle A,I\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_{S_0}=\\mathrm{Const}_{S_0}\\cup\\mathrm{Func}_{S_0}\\cup\\mathrm{Rel}_{S_0}\">\\(N_{S_0}=\\mathrm{Const}_{S_0}\\cup\\mathrm{Func}_{S_0}\\cup\\mathrm{Rel}_{S_0}\\)</span>；函数图限制见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"691f08ea84f57992\" href=\"?note=691f08ea84f57992\" title=\"57-df-function-restriction\">57-df-function-restriction</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reduct}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright S_0\\coloneqq\\langle A,I\\upharpoonright N_{S_0}\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}reduct}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright S_0\\coloneqq\\langle A,I\\upharpoonright N_{S_0}\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright S_0,S_0),\\qquad\n|\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright S_0|=A,\\qquad\n\\forall a\\in N_{S_0}\\ (a^{\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright S_0}=a^{\\mathfrak A}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright S_0,S_0),\\qquad\n|\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright S_0|=A,\\qquad\n\\forall a\\in N_{S_0}\\ (a^{\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright S_0}=a^{\\mathfrak A}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>归约只删除非逻辑符号的解释，既不改变论域，也不把逻辑字母当作有结构解释的常量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","l